  "ja84:0.4": "84. Atthassadvārajātakaṃ 84. ",
  "ja84:1.1": "Ārogyamicche paramañca lābhaṃ, ",
  "ja84:1.2": "sīlañca vuddhānumataṃ sutañca; ",
  "ja84:1.3": "Dhammānuvattī ca alīnatā ca, ",
  "ja84:1.4": "atthassa dvārā pamukhā chaḷeteti. ",
  "ja84:2.1": "Atthassadvārajātakaṃ catutthaṃ. "
}
